<title>USA: Redbook sales said up 0.8 pct w/e May 17-sources.</title>
<headline>Redbook sales said up 0.8 pct w/e May 17-sources.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Redbook Retail Sales Index was expected to show a rise of 0.8 percent in the period ending May 17, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Lynch, Jones &amp; Ryan Inc will report the Redbook Index later on Tuesday at 1355 EDT/1755 GMT, an hour earlier than usual due to the Federal Reserve's policy setting meeting this afternoon.</p>
<p>((-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
